{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は晩御飯\n美味しいものいっぱいたべたんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を食べたかは\nまだ内緒！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな今日もいい夢みてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短くてごめんね。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたはセミナーがんばるぞ！"}],"source":"archive"}